      <dependency task="A38b" status="parallel-safe">A38b (task 205g) gates `customer.bicep` `kvSecretValues` entries behind a `requireSecretFreeIdentity` bool param. A38c is orthogonal (operator-invoked entry points, not Bicep-invoked); no direct dependency, but the three (A38a + A38b + A38c) MUST land in the same commit bundle for defense-in-depth per peer escalation re-scope.</dependency>
