  <constraints>
    <constraint source="peer escalation record (auth-v4-integration-draft-punch-rows.md lines 76-99, owner approved 2026-08-25)">MUST land the gate at ALL 5 grep-verified call sites (Rotate-Secrets.ps1 `:588` + `:661`; Seed-ProductionKeyVault.ps1 `:123` + `:178`; Provision-Customer.ps1 `:533`). MUST NOT partial-apply (partial omit re-opens the false-migrated trap the escalation identified).</constraint>
    <constraint source="peer escalation record §Proposed complete omit-set re-scope A38c bullet">Detection convention MUST use KV resource tag `spaarke-secret-free-identity` OR `sprk_dataverseenvironment` state field `sprk_credentialmode=secret-free`. Do NOT invent a parallel convention — A38a is single source of truth; A38c/A43/A44 CONSUME it.</constraint>
    <constraint source="§10.5 trap class + auth-v4 task 033 retirement">MUST NOT re-add `BFF-API-ClientSecret` rotation branch to `Rotate-Secrets.ps1:604-619` (verified no-op per auth-v4 task 033 ✓). MUST NOT re-add `BFF-API-ClientSecret` seed to `Seed-ProductionKeyVault.ps1` (verified REMOVED 2026-08-24 per auth-v4 task 033 ✓). Auth-v4 task 033 retirement facts are LOAD-BEARING invariants preserved by this row.</constraint>
    <constraint source="A43 precedent (Deploy-AllIndexes.ps1:617-660)">FAIL-LOUD shape MUST mirror A43: `Write-Error` naming the marker + linking to A38a omit contract (constraint file path + row number) + non-zero exit code (choose a distinct code from A43's exit 6 — suggest exit 7 or reuse A43's exit 6 with different message; document choice in inline comment). MUST NOT invent a divergent shape (operator consistency across the auth-v4 gate surface).</constraint>
    <constraint source="§9.1 (marker location, BINDING)">Positive migration marker = KV tag OR provisioning-state field, NEVER a sentinel value in the credential slot. A38c gate MUST read the marker from a KV tag OR from `sprk_dataverseenvironment.sprk_credentialmode`, NEVER from the secret value.</constraint>
    <constraint source="§10.3 (fleet consistency, Model 2)">Under Model 2, N per-customer `kv-{customerId}-{secretsVer}` vaults each carry their own tag. Gate MUST work identically across N vaults; MUST NOT assume Model 1 shared-KV shape. Document in inline comment block above each gate.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028 A4 (per master merge A35)">MUST NOT introduce any code path that re-mints auth-v4-retired credentials (`BFF-API-ClientSecret`, `ServiceBus-ConnectionString`, `AiSearch--AdminKey`) on secret-free envs. Refusal is the ONLY correct behavior when marker present.</constraint>
    <constraint source="§6.5 owner-narrowed disposition (2026-08-25, prong 3 collapse)">Gate MUST NOT gate `Dataverse-ClientSecret` (protected under narrow Path A through 2026-11-23 sunset per §6.5). Gate ONLY the auth-v4-retired credentials (`ServiceBus-ConnectionString`, `AiSearch--AdminKey`). Rotation/seed paths for `Dataverse-ClientSecret` remain UNTOUCHED.</constraint>
    <constraint source="Provision-Customer.ps1 §5.2 supersession">Provision-Customer.ps1 is the legacy 13-step orchestrator superseded by L2 control-plane. Deprecation banner at script entry is optional-but-recommended (names §5.2 supersession + links to L2 entry point); the gate at `:533` is BINDING regardless of banner.</constraint>
    <constraint source="Redis rotation scope exclusion">MUST NOT touch Redis rotation branches in `Rotate-Secrets.ps1` (separate concern; not part of auth-v4 secret-free migration). Grep-verify Redis branches remain byte-identical after edit.</constraint>
    <constraint source="idempotency invariant">Scripts MUST remain idempotent: repeated runs against a secret-free env produce identical no-op behavior (refuse consistently, no partial writes). Repeated runs against a pre-migration env produce identical current behavior (backwards compat).</constraint>
    <constraint source="root CLAUDE.md §3 Sub-Agent Write Boundary">A38c edits `scripts/*.ps1` (NOT `.claude/**`) — sub-agent write boundary N/A for the script edits. `notes/auth-v4-integration-draft-punch-rows.md` annotation edit is main-session-safe (project notes are not `.claude/`).</constraint>
    <constraint source="root CLAUDE.md §11 component justification">The gate is an EXTENSION of the A43 `-CutoverBffSettings` precedent applied to three additional operator scripts — not a new component. If a new tests file is created, MUST cite punch row A38c in file header + answer Existing/Extension/Cost-of-doing-nothing per §11.</constraint>
    <constraint source="line-number drift check">Line numbers in the peer escalation record (`:588`, `:661`, `:604-619`, `:123`, `:178`, `:533`) are grep-verified as of 2026-08-25. If any of the three scripts has been refactored since (check `git log --oneline -- scripts/Rotate-Secrets.ps1 scripts/Seed-ProductionKeyVault.ps1 scripts/Provision-Customer.ps1`), reconcile with the latest state before applying (see Escalation trigger `script-refactored-since-2026-08-25`).</constraint>
  </constraints>

