      (a) `Rotate-Secrets.ps1`: `ServiceBus-ConnectionString` write at approximately `:588` (platform vault) + `:661` (per-customer vaults); `BFF-API-ClientSecret` no-op at `:604-619` (must remain UNTOUCHED — grep-confirm no-op still present).
      (b) `Seed-ProductionKeyVault.ps1`: `ServiceBus-ConnectionString` at approximately `:123`; `AiSearch--AdminKey` at approximately `:178`; grep-confirm `BFF-API-ClientSecret` seed is ABSENT (verified REMOVED per auth-v4 task 033).
