    <step order="7" name="Apply gate — Provision-Customer.ps1 (:533)">EDIT `scripts/Provision-Customer.ps1` to insert `Assert-SpaarkeSecretFreeGateNotTripped` BEFORE the `ServiceBus-ConnectionString` entry in the `$secrets` hashtable at `:533` (or, if the hashtable literal cannot host a gate, reorganize the surrounding block to compute the gated value before hashtable construction, then omit the entry when gate refuses). Optionally add a deprecation banner at script entry (top-of-file) naming §5.2 L2 control-plane supersession + linking to `/provision-environment` skill entry point — banner is optional-but-recommended per peer escalation record.</step>
