      (c) INTEGRATION — repeated runs against a marker-tagged mock env assert idempotent no-op (no partial writes);
      (d) INTEGRATION — repeated runs against a pre-migration mock env assert current behavior byte-identical across runs;
      (e) NEGATIVE — `BFF-API-ClientSecret` MUST NOT appear in any script's write path post-edit (grep-assert; guards against accidental reintroduction);
