    <trigger name="bff-api-clientsecret-branch-resurrected">If Step 1 grep reveals `BFF-API-ClientSecret` rotation branch has been RE-ADDED to `Rotate-Secrets.ps1` (i.e., `:604-619` is no longer a no-op) OR seeding has been RE-ADDED to `Seed-ProductionKeyVault.ps1`, STOP — auth-v4 task 033 retirement has been reverted; escalate to owner immediately per §6.5 owner sign-off record (this violates the APPROVED Path C pivot-to-comply).</trigger>
